      "name": "smthing-Configurable Steps Volume",
      "slug": "smthing-configurable-steps-volume",
      "teaser": "Lower the volume of your footsteps for you only, bots still hear you normally.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2246.png",
      "downloads": 10760,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>Please refer to original mod for description and how to install it. I simply updated it to work on 3.9.X.</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1971-configurable-steps-volume/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CLICK ME-Configurable Steps Volume by smthing</a></strong></p>\n<p>****I streamlined the installation process. Simply drag the user folder into your main Spt Directory and enjoy a world of silence.</p>\n<p>If <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/15199-smthing/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">smthing</a></strong> wants it removed. It will be removed without warning.</p>\n<p><strong>If you wanna edit the volume percentage, go to SPT\\user\\mods\\SPT-ConfigurableStepsVolume-1.1.1 and open the config.json. Change 45 to whatever you prefer. Making it 100 is complete silence. I would go to more than 60.</strong></p>\n",
